{"4926410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "I got the ZOOMIES!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!", "steam_appid": 4926410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Congrats!</strong> You won a legit phone, which you can claim by clicking the <strong>super tiny “Claim” button</strong> on the <i>totally not</i> suspicious ad. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All you have to do is zoom in to make the button go bigger and claim your prize!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926410/extras/607a64d6e62e04d3b6670b4a79380a9e.poster.avif?t=1786712505\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926410/extras/607a64d6e62e04d3b6670b4a79380a9e.webm?t=1786712505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926410/extras/607a64d6e62e04d3b6670b4a79380a9e.mp4?t=1786712505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As you play, you earn more cash and precious Z-Bucks to upgrade your Zoomie companions and let them do the job for you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926410/extras/22cbefbab970fe2469cc57a5d953c8fa.poster.avif?t=1786712505\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926410/extras/22cbefbab970fe2469cc57a5d953c8fa.webm?t=1786712505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926410/extras/22cbefbab970fe2469cc57a5d953c8fa.mp4?t=1786712505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage multiple tabs at once and recruit more Zoomies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926410/extras/24a9916e2e26b50f99dbfefd172e025c.poster.avif?t=1786712505\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926410/extras/24a9916e2e26b50f99dbfefd172e025c.webm?t=1786712505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926410/extras/24a9916e2e26b50f99dbfefd172e025c.mp4?t=1786712505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FACTS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate your ZOOMing journey with the help of Zoomies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy browser extensions to unlock meta upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cycle through various tabs, each introducing a new mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add your own images to the colorful mix of predefined stock images</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twitch integration for streamers! Wohoo!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game will give you the zoomies and possibly even 💥 tendonitis*!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*We cannot be held liable for any wrist pain resulting from scrolling the mouse wheel or the incorrect use of Z-Bucks to upgrade skills 🙅</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Congrats!</strong> You won a legit phone, which you can claim by clicking the <strong>super tiny “Claim” button</strong> on the <i>totally not</i> suspicious ad. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All you have to do is zoom in to make the button go bigger and claim your prize!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926410/extras/607a64d6e62e04d3b6670b4a79380a9e.poster.avif?t=1786712505\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926410/extras/607a64d6e62e04d3b6670b4a79380a9e.webm?t=1786712505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926410/extras/607a64d6e62e04d3b6670b4a79380a9e.mp4?t=1786712505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As you play, you earn more cash and precious Z-Bucks to upgrade your Zoomie companions and let them do the job for you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926410/extras/22cbefbab970fe2469cc57a5d953c8fa.poster.avif?t=1786712505\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926410/extras/22cbefbab970fe2469cc57a5d953c8fa.webm?t=1786712505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926410/extras/22cbefbab970fe2469cc57a5d953c8fa.mp4?t=1786712505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage multiple tabs at once and recruit more Zoomies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4926410/extras/24a9916e2e26b50f99dbfefd172e025c.poster.avif?t=1786712505\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.ak